<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1000s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 11th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1000s, 613 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 209 were founded and 135 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Chola Empire, the Byzantine Empire and the Abbasid Caliphate.</p></header>
